<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύφακτ-ος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ὁ,</span> later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύφακτος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>BCH</u>
			35.23
		</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			<u>OGI</u>
			598.3
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Jerusalem</span>), Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			2.595
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>railing</i>
			or <i>latticed partition,</i> serving as <i>the bar</i> of the
			courts of law, the council-chamber, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				380
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερεπήδων τοὺς δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					675
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῖς δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					386
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῖς δ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				552
			</span></i>, X <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.55
			</span></i>: sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρυφάκτου τρόπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					<u>Poliorc.</u>
					172.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hand-rail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.22.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>balcony,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				50.2
			</span></i>:—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύφρακτοι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				11.217
			</span></i>. (By dissim. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύ-φρακτος
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράσσω</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Hellad.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2p.746D.
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
			</span></i> l. c.)</div>
